+/**
+ * Runs the compute job named by an SQL {@code EXECUTE} statement.
+ *
+ * <p>The SQL engine cannot depend on the compute module (compute depends on SQL), so the node registers an implementation on start.
+ */
+public interface ExecuteHandler {
+    /**
+     * Runs the job on a cluster node and completes with its result rendered as a string.
